docs/fvets-11-1497817.pdf — the AVCG paper
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Boeykens, F. et al. (2024). "Development and validation of animal variant
  classification guidelines to objectively evaluate genetic variant pathogenicity
  in domestic animals."
  Frontiers in Veterinary Science 11:1497817.
  https://doi.org/10.3389/fvets.2024.1497817

  Licence:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Copyright: the authors.

  Redistributed unmodified. CC BY 4.0 permits redistribution with attribution,
  which this notice provides.

  It is included because Janook implements the guidelines this paper defines, and
  a reader checking whether the implementation is faithful should not have to go
  looking for the specification. Criterion definitions, weights and the decision
  tree all trace back to it.

  AVCG is the standard. Janook is one implementation of it, and carries no
  endorsement from the paper's authors.


